{"version":1,"key":"card:635","content":{"id":635,"content":[{"children":[{"text":"为什么节食不行：我们的身体通过代谢率来控制输出，当节食时大脑会以为进入了饥荒状态，会降低代谢率，导致疲劳，烦躁，当恢复饮食时会迅速反弹。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"eea06263-2a63-408a-809c-e29a7e64920e","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"影响因素：","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"4820e479-042d-46c5-8c50-0252e6cedfed","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"果糖，不是指水果中和纤维混在一起的糖，而是指人工加工的果糖，果糖不像葡萄糖可以被细胞利用，果糖的代谢路径只有被肝脏转化为脂肪","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"8e3edb8d-e71a-47d0-b245-e3fbe73743c9","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"78194074-23d9-41ec-a346-344223072644","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"瘦素抵抗，瘦素是脂肪细胞分泌的激素，告诉大脑已经够了，不必再吃了，但是超重的人会分泌大量瘦素，导致大脑无法处理这么多瘦素，导致瘦素抵抗，机制失灵，反而会让我们产生饥饿感，疯狂的吃东西","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"60f39c99-fbc9-463e-9e8c-f738cad988c7","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"adf8a1b3-e80a-4175-8454-1ced3769b166","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"胰岛素风暴，当我们吃下大量碳水时（白米饭、白面等），血糖水平迅速升高，会刺激我们的胰腺分泌胰岛素，胰岛素会促使这个葡萄糖进入细胞被分解利用，而无法被分解的就会被转化为脂肪存储，由于产生的大量胰岛素会导致血糖迅速下降，会重新产生饥饿感，而且会伴随着大量葡萄糖转化为脂肪","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"3e46f4c0-4ec4-4bda-bda3-f5dbc49facd3","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"3816bd20-f74f-4f4d-bb9a-c69bca9cfd48","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"压力，在远古时期，外部压力会导致我们生成皮质醇激素，这种激素会促使我们战斗和逃跑，但是在现代，我们压力来自于KPI、领导、房贷等，持续的皮质醇水平会让你倾向于高热量食物，并且更倾向于把脂肪存储在腹部","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"2c9ec001-47a0-4957-9690-8aa39e9475f2","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"783803a1-4099-4a5b-ab6f-2881b36e8e98","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"睡眠，睡眠不足会导致体内饥饿素飙升，瘦素水平下降","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"394b1e5c-41ac-4f23-aab4-49eaa14ce2c7","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"041eb12d-66c6-49ed-859a-42763163c4e7","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"}],"collabId":"1f2fac4b-a960-45f6-a7ac-cd7541e4e072","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","type":"bulleted-list"},{"children":[{"text":"解决办法：发送正确信号给大脑，我们现在的环境很安全，不需要这么多脂肪了。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"8973a2dd-a663-4f06-a57a-8e557bd2d0a3","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"饮食习惯，减少加工食物（糖，精致碳水）的摄入","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"c300de12-4f10-4510-a9f5-e172acaa6795","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"甜甜圈 → 牛油果沙拉","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"0d80edc8-54e2-4dae-b977-750795b80ddc","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"61b0d5a8-47b4-4126-adfe-cbde570b8d07","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"果汁 → 完整的水果（包含纤维，可减缓葡萄糖水平飙升）","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"0159dc36-6a62-47e3-aa52-f906580faea1","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"ab812c85-54e8-4de1-a31d-645fd3d1e5fd","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"}],"collabId":"8c84ee73-7549-4bc6-a0b7-dcc60053f865","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","type":"bulleted-list"}],"collabId":"cef79db9-50e6-4dcc-94b4-aae67260a620","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"轻断食，适度拉长进食间隔，十几个小时不进食，胰岛素水平下降，从燃糖变为燃脂","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"9d874290-0dc2-4d60-b0bd-c09853aed77c","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"d9261ccf-9ae5-4d41-a468-fa2b02d95767","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"改变生活环境，听音乐，和朋友聊天，降低压力","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"e788a88c-8bdd-43c3-8c23-4f207bbb29d0","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"94008352-2499-47c6-a446-93cfbae9e7ae","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"保证充足睡眠","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"d4aa2157-0944-4374-9aa6-1f2460b18a22","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"1b0a80fd-ecbc-451e-a850-4d5993011335","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"运动","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"dd6422b7-d886-4ff1-97ed-41b3bde78478","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"目的不是为了燃烧卡路里，消耗掉的一杯奶茶就补回来了，而且还会刺激你的饥饿感","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"1bdf4ec0-a90d-49eb-a9f8-015b7d14dd2b","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"06c751b0-13d7-4dc2-bba2-0ae5e2b1721e","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"而是发送强大的信号，告诉我们的身体需要更强大的肌肉，特别是力量训练，增加肌肉量，提高基础代谢率，减少胰岛素抵抗","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"6eb3ebcf-3ad4-44dc-9e74-f8d8f8ea190c","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"06156d47-6a0b-4e1a-a8f3-81c9ae8a58ed","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"}],"collabId":"b1d38c8a-4829-4710-8cf4-3957c09bfed7","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","type":"bulleted-list"}],"collabId":"ca3474d5-8c70-4ae0-8ca0-b507b8fb75bb","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"}],"collabId":"39a0b94e-79b1-47a0-a6fa-2172df9fa7bb","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","type":"bulleted-list"},{"children":[{"text":"参考资料：","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"cf53a28f-9675-45fd-bccd-3515bf9643f6","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"外科医生揭秘：重设你的体重开关，让身体主动为你减肥！","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"343b16a6-c9e7-4413-a7d4-47a6776128ab","openEdit":false,"tauContract":"ebf1d56e356279ad64279a16e90d9b28280f70eac20d5071950fc0c4b5c364a6","type":"link","url":"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1qKstzJE8d"}